'''Terry's Shack''' is a [[Location]] on {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.

{{ZoneText|Talk to Terry.|Browse Terry's unique wares.}}
== Purpose ==
{{NPCSprite|Terry}} is an [[NPC]] located inside '''Terry's Shack'''. They sell {{Green|4}} different [[Reforge Stones]]: {{Item|Salt Cube}}, {{Item|Rusty Anchor}}, {{Item|Terry's Snowglobe}} and {{Item|Frozen Bauble}}. Previously, they used to apply the {{Reforge|Salty}} and {{Reforge|Treacherous}} reforges onto [[Fishing Rods]] at a cost.

